{"5216700":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"I Feel Great","steam_appid":5216700,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5216700\/extras\/50faee3043cbdb79f8c81b4fb06e6b1e.avif?t=1793646164\" width=1003 height=235 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You drive to work, type on a keyboard for eight hours, come home, and the TV runs while you're not really listening. The next email says your rent is going up. The one after that says your job interview got cancelled.<br><br><strong>None of this is unusual.<\/strong><br><br>A job, an apartment, a room that isn't like the others. Sometimes life isn't enough to just live it.<br><br><br><br><i>A 10-15 minute interactive narrative about everyday life, exhaustion, and what lies beneath it. Inspired by the song &quot;I'll Always Kill Myself Too Late&quot;.<\/i><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5216700\/extras\/50faee3043cbdb79f8c81b4fb06e6b1e.avif?t=1793646164\" width=1003 height=235 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You drive to work, type on a keyboard for eight hours, come home, and the TV runs while you're not really listening. The next email says your rent is going up. The one after that says your job interview got cancelled.<br><br><strong>None of this is unusual.<\/strong><br><br>A job, an apartment, a room that isn't like the others. Sometimes life isn't enough to just live it.<br><br><br><br><i>A 10-15 minute interactive narrative about everyday life, exhaustion, and what lies beneath it. Inspired by the song &quot;I'll Always Kill Myself Too Late&quot;.<\/i><\/p>","short_description":"A short interactive narrative w